/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  chemistryDict -- the case's ACTIVE-CHEMISTRY SELECTION: WHICH solid phases
  are admitted in this system's chemistry network.  Availability, not
  presence: the Ksp/dH facts live in the phase/component records (arity-1),
  and only an OPERATION asks for saturation or precipitation.  The membrane
  module reports a subset of these (`scaling { reportMinerals ( ... ); }`)
  and may not name a phase that is not admitted here.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType    chemistrySystem;
schemaVersion 1;

equilibria
{
    solidPhases ( calcite gypsum );
}
